  button "Release" => "إفلات";
  /// AssignControl · a button's label · at most ~13 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  button "Take it" => "تولَّها";
  /// AssignControl · a button's label · at most ~18 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  button "Take it over" => "تولَّها بدلًا منه";
  /// AssignControl · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~13 characters
  /// shown through Menu.label
  label "Hand to" => "تسليم إلى";
  /// AssignControl · text on the page
  text "Assignee" => "المسؤول";
  /// AssignControl · text on the page
  text "Nobody may hold this — its queue has no members who hold the skills it needs." => "لا يمكن لأحد تولّي هذا، فقائمة انتظاره ليس فيها أعضاء يملكون المهارات التي يحتاجها.";

  // ── Osysharp.Inbox · BudgetWords ──
